Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,square wave is made of spinning circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Any repeating shape can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,be built from sine waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.41,0:00:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A square wave equals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,four over pi, times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the sum of odd sine harmonics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Start with the first harmonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Add the third harmonic, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the shape starts to sharpen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The fifth harmonic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,adds more corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven terms, and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,already looks like a staircase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine terms, the square
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,wave is almost perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep adding odd harmonics forever, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you get a perfect square wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Fourier series.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow for more math magic.